# Normalize text files to LF in git-native storage. Working-tree files
# may still be CRLF on Windows checkouts if the developer's core.autocrlf
# is set that way; what matters is the bytes git stores and the diffs
# review tools see. Prevents future "trailing whitespace" false positives
# from `git diff --check` on CRLF lines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not go through text conversion.
*.png    binary
*.ico    binary
*.icns   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.pcap   binary
*.pcapng binary
*.mmdb   binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip    binary
*.dmg    binary
